This module is VictorLaunch's planned in-tree fork/embed of the
Shizuku server, starter, and manager — plus a client that talks to
the stock Shizuku app until that embed lands.

Apache License 2.0 §6 (from upstream README), obeyed here:

- We do not ship Shizuku's mipmap launcher icons.
- This app is named VictorLaunch, applicationId
  com.victorious.launch — never moe.shizuku.privileged.api.
- We do not declare moe.shizuku.manager.permission.* permissions.

Shizuku-API (https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku-API) is consumed
as the Maven artifacts `dev.rikka.shizuku:api` and
`dev.rikka.shizuku:provider` (Apache-2.0 / MIT per that repo).
